  'dom.transferLockHint': 'Raises an alarm when the domain has no transfer lock (clientTransferProhibited). Without it, anyone who takes over the registrar account can move the domain to another registrar. The lock can only be verified on extensions that support RDAP; where it cannot be verified (for example .tr) NO alarm is raised and the state reads "Could not verify".',
